  [("def plan(features, capacity):\n    chosen = []\n    for name, hours in features:\n        if hours < capacity:\n            chosen.append(name)\n            capacity -= hours\n    return chosen\n", "Функция, помещающаяся ровно, отбрасывается."),
   ("def plan(features, capacity):\n    chosen = []\n    for name, hours in features:\n        if hours <= capacity:\n            chosen.append(name)\n    return chosen\n", "Оставшееся время не уменьшается.")],
